(globalThis.CATALOGUE_RECORD_CHUNKS??=Object.create(null))[350]={"source_order":350,"notes":["Because the show-through is so faint, a very faint original pencil addition could not be entirely excluded. None was distinguished from the reversed ghost text on inspection of the native tiles.","The ruled page is otherwise empty. All faint text-like traces were judged to be bleed-through from the recto, fol. 175, because they are mirror-reversed and the shelfmark column appears on the right.","The stacked page edges visible at the left gutter belong to underlying leaves and are not part of the target page.","The native tiles were reviewed across the whole canvas: top, middle, bottom, outer and gutter margins, and interlinear spaces. Apart from the folio numeral, the ruled page has no original writing.","Faint mirror-reversed show-through of the entries on fol. 175 (recto) is visible across the page, approx. [340,560,2860,3900]. This includes a reversed shelfmark column near the right edge and a faint diagonal stroke, approx. [1400,1550,700,700], which corresponds to the cancellation stroke on fol. 175. This show-through is not writing on this page and has not been transcribed.","Small dark specks are non-textual blemishes, e.g. near the gutter at approx. [330,1280,30,40] and scattered elsewhere.","The stacked leaf edges at the left gutter belong to underlying leaves and are outside the target page.","Because the show-through is very faint, a very faint original pencil addition cannot be wholly excluded. None could be distinguished from the reversed ghost text in the native tiles.","The show-through is very faint and covers the page. A very faint original pencil addition cannot be wholly excluded, although none could be separated from the reversed ghost text in the native tiles. This includes faint traces near the left-margin ghost notes, at about y 2650-2850, and below the folio numeral."],"records":[]};
